IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `eta-transferable-secure`

-- Electronic Transactions Act 2010, Part 2A, Part 3 and the Third Schedule -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or the regulations under the Act (none were retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_eta.py). Expected results were written
-- by hand from the text.

§ `Fixtures`

`an electronic bill of lading on a well-run platform` MEANS TransferableRecord WITH
    `contains the information the paper document would need` IS TRUE
    `identifies the authoritative record by a reliable method` IS TRUE
    `subject to control from creation to end by a reliable method` IS TRUE
    `integrity retained by a reliable method` IS TRUE
    `exclusive control established by a reliable method` IS TRUE
    `the person in control identified by a reliable method` IS TRUE

`an electronic bill of lading with shared control` MEANS TransferableRecord WITH
    `contains the information the paper document would need` IS TRUE
    `identifies the authoritative record by a reliable method` IS TRUE
    `subject to control from creation to end by a reliable method` IS TRUE
    `integrity retained by a reliable method` IS TRUE
    `exclusive control established by a reliable method` IS FALSE
    `the person in control identified by a reliable method` IS TRUE

`an emailed PDF of a bill of lading` MEANS TransferableRecord WITH
    `contains the information the paper document would need` IS TRUE
    `identifies the authoritative record by a reliable method` IS FALSE
    `subject to control from creation to end by a reliable method` IS FALSE
    `integrity retained by a reliable method` IS FALSE
    `exclusive control established by a reliable method` IS FALSE
    `the person in control identified by a reliable method` IS FALSE

`a record with no authoritative copy` MEANS TransferableRecord WITH
    `contains the information the paper document would need` IS TRUE
    `identifies the authoritative record by a reliable method` IS FALSE
    `subject to control from creation to end by a reliable method` IS TRUE
    `integrity retained by a reliable method` IS TRUE
    `exclusive control established by a reliable method` IS TRUE
    `the person in control identified by a reliable method` IS TRUE

`a record whose integrity is not kept` MEANS TransferableRecord WITH
    `contains the information the paper document would need` IS TRUE
    `identifies the authoritative record by a reliable method` IS TRUE
    `subject to control from creation to end by a reliable method` IS TRUE
    `integrity retained by a reliable method` IS FALSE
    `exclusive control established by a reliable method` IS TRUE
    `the person in control identified by a reliable method` IS TRUE

`a record whose whole life was on an accredited system` MEANS SystemUse WITH
