§ `s 16D -- derogation`

#ASSERT `the derogation is permitted` `none of Part 2A`
#ASSERT NOT `the derogation is permitted` `some of Part 2A`
#ASSERT `the derogation is permitted` `all of Part 2A`

§ `ss 16H, 16I`

#ASSERT `the record is an electronic transferable record` `an electronic bill of lading on a well-run platform`
#ASSERT `the record is an electronic transferable record` `an electronic bill of lading with shared control`
#ASSERT NOT `the record is an electronic transferable record` `an emailed PDF of a bill of lading`
#ASSERT NOT `the record is an electronic transferable record` `a record with no authoritative copy`
#ASSERT NOT `the record is an electronic transferable record` `a record whose integrity is not kept`

#ASSERT `a person has possession of the record` `an electronic bill of lading on a well-run platform`
#ASSERT NOT `a person has possession of the record` `an electronic bill of lading with shared control`
#ASSERT NOT `a person has possession of the record` `an emailed PDF of a bill of lading`
#ASSERT NOT `a person has possession of the record` `a record with no authoritative copy`
#ASSERT NOT `a person has possession of the record` `a record whose integrity is not kept`

§ `s 16O -- presumed reliability`

#ASSERT `reliability is presumed under section 16O(2)` `a record whose whole life was on an accredited system`
#ASSERT NOT `reliability is presumed under section 16O(2)` `a record issued elsewhere then moved to an accredited system`
#ASSERT NOT `reliability is presumed under section 16O(2)` `a record on an accredited system after the provider's registration lapsed`
#ASSERT NOT `reliability is presumed under section 16O(2)` `a record on an unaccredited system`

§ `ss 16M, 16N -- change of medium`

#ASSERT `the change of medium takes effect` `a paper bill converted with a statement`
#ASSERT NOT `the change of medium takes effect` `a paper bill converted without a statement`
#ASSERT `the change of medium takes effect` `an electronic bill printed without its vessel tracking data`
#ASSERT NOT `the change of medium takes effect` `an electronic bill printed with a missing clause`
#ASSERT NOT `the change of medium takes effect` `an electronic bill printed by an unreliable method`

#ASSERT `the replaced document ceases to have effect` `a paper bill converted with a statement`
#ASSERT NOT `the replaced document ceases to have effect` `a paper bill converted without a statement`
#ASSERT `the replaced document ceases to have effect` `an electronic bill printed without its vessel tracking data`
#ASSERT NOT `the replaced document ceases to have effect` `an electronic bill printed with a missing clause`
#ASSERT NOT `the replaced document ceases to have effect` `an electronic bill printed by an unreliable method`

§ `ss 17 to 19 -- secure records and signatures`

#ASSERT `the procedure qualifies under sections 17 and 18` `a specified security procedure`
#ASSERT `the procedure qualifies under sections 17 and 18` `a commercially reasonable procedure agreed by the parties`
#ASSERT NOT `the procedure qualifies under sections 17 and 18` `a commercially reasonable procedure not agreed`
#ASSERT NOT `the procedure qualifies under sections 17 and 18` `an unreasonable procedure agreed by the parties`
#ASSERT NOT `the procedure qualifies under sections 17 and 18` `no procedure`

#ASSERT `the signature is a secure electronic signature` `a digital signature on a smart card`
#ASSERT `the signature is a secure electronic signature` `an agreed bank token signature`
#ASSERT NOT `the signature is a secure electronic signature` `a shared-password signature`
#ASSERT NOT `the signature is a secure electronic signature` `a signature not tied to the record`
#ASSERT NOT `the signature is a secure electronic signature` `an unagreed procedure signature`
#ASSERT NOT `the signature is a secure electronic signature` `a scanned handwritten signature`

#ASSERT `the record is a secure electronic record` `a specified security procedure` TRUE
#ASSERT `the record is a secure electronic record` `a commercially reasonable procedure agreed by the parties` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the record is a secure electronic record` `a commercially reasonable procedure not agreed` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the record is a secure electronic record` `an unreasonable procedure agreed by the parties` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the record is a secure electronic record` `no procedure` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the record is a secure electronic record` `a specified security procedure` FALSE

#ASSERT `the signature is presumed to be the person's, affixed with intent to sign` `a digital signature on a smart card` FALSE
#ASSERT `the signature is presumed to be the person's, affixed with intent to sign` `an agreed bank token signature` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the signature is presumed to be the person's, affixed with intent to sign` `a shared-password signature` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the signature is presumed to be the person's, affixed with intent to sign` `a signature not tied to the record` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the signature is presumed to be the person's, affixed with intent to sign` `an unagreed procedure signature` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the signature is presumed to be the person's, affixed with intent to sign` `a scanned handwritten signature` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the signature is presumed to be the person's, affixed with intent to sign` `a digital signature on a smart card` TRUE

